---
// Platform footer
---
<footer class="bg-[#1A120B] text-[#FDFBF7] pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-[#3E2723]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#D4A373] mb-3">GreenVerse Delivery</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
        Full-option psychedelics platform offering secure nationwide and cross-border express delivery. 100% lab tested and verified.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#D4A373] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Quick Links</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-stone-300">
        <li><a href="/shop" class="hover:text-[#D4A373]">Full Catalog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/shop/chocolates" class="hover:text-[#D4A373]">Artisan Chocolates</a></li>
        <li><a href="/shop/strains" class="hover:text-[#D4A373]">Dried Strains</a></li>
        <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-[#D4A373]">Shipping FAQ</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#D4A373] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Compliance</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
        Strictly 21+ compliance. All shipments are vacuum-sealed, climate-controlled, and fully tracked.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#D4A373] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Support Hours</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">
        24/7 Dispatch Desk & Customer Support via Telegram and Secure Email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 border-t border-stone-800 text-center text-[11px] text-stone-500">
    &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} GreenVerse Delivery. All rights reserved. Headquartered in Los Angeles, CA.
  </div>
</footer>